---
// Essence.astro — "Nuestra Esencia" storytelling section
---

<section id="esencia" class="relative bg-kraken-deep py-10 md:py-24 lg:py-36 overflow-hidden">

  <!-- Background texture -->
  <div class="absolute inset-0 opacity-30"
    style="background-image: url('data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg width=\'60\' height=\'60\' viewBox=\'0 0 60 60\' xmlns=\'http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\'%3E%3Cg fill=\'none\' fill-rule=\'evenodd\'%3E%3Cg fill=\'%23c9a84c\' fill-opacity=\'0.03\'%3E%3Cpath d=\'M36 34v-4h-2v4h-4v2h4v4h2v-4h4v-2h-4zm0-30V0h-2v4h-4v2h4v4h2V6h4V4h-4zM6 34v-4H4v4H0v2h4v4h2v-4h4v-2H6zM6 4V0H4v4H0v2h4v4h2V6h4V4H6z\'/%3E%3C/g%3E%3C/g%3E%3C/svg%3E');">
  </div>

  <!-- Decorative compass rose (top-right) -->
  <div class="absolute -top-20 -right-20 w-80 h-80 opacity-5 pointer-events-none select-none animate-spin-slow">
    <svg viewBox="0 0 200 200" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" fill="#c9a84c">
      <polygon points="100,10 110,90 100,100 90,90"/>
      <polygon points="100,190 110,110 100,100 90,110"/>
      <polygon points="10,100 90,90 100,100 90,110"/>
      <polygon points="190,100 110,90 100,100 110,110"/>
      <polygon points="100,10 107,93 100,100 93,93" opacity="0.5"/>
      <polygon points="100,190 107,107 100,100 93,107" opacity="0.5"/>
      <polygon points="10,100 93,107 100,100 93,93" opacity="0.5"/>
      <polygon points="190,100 107,107 100,100 107,93" opacity="0.5"/>
      <circle cx="100" cy="100" r="8" fill="none" stroke="#c9a84c" stroke-width="2"/>
      <circle cx="100" cy="100" r="4"/>
    </svg>
  </div>

  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-6">

    <!-- Section label -->
    <div class="flex items-center gap-4 mb-6 md:mb-14 reveal">
      <div class="h-px flex-1 max-w-[80px] bg-kraken-gold/40"></div>
      <span class="font-cinzel text-xs tracking-[0.4em] text-kraken-gold/70 uppercase">Nuestra Esencia</span>
      <div class="h-px flex-1 max-w-[80px] bg-kraken-gold/40"></div>
    </div>

    <!-- ASYMMETRIC LAYOUT: image left + story right -->
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-2 gap-5 md:gap-12 lg:gap-20 items-center">

      <!-- LEFT — Photograph collage -->
      <div class="reveal from-left">
        <div class="relative">

          <!-- Main large photo -->
          <div class="relative overflow-hidden border border-kraken-gold/20 shadow-[0_20px_80px_rgba(0,0,0,0.6)]">
            <!-- NOTA DEV: Usar foto "xiringuito-el-kraken.jpeg" — chiringuito en la playa con cielo azul y la gente -->
            <img
              src="/imagenes/xiringuito-el-kraken.jpeg"
              alt="El Kraken Chiringuito en la playa de El Prat de Llobregat, Barcelona"
              class="w-full h-[420px] object-cover object-center filter saturate-90 contrast-105 transition-transform duration-700 hover:scale-105"
            />
            <!-- Gold overlay gradient -->
            <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-t from-kraken-deep/60 via-transparent to-transparent"></div>
            <!-- Small text badge bottom-left -->
            <div class="absolute bottom-4 left-4 bg-kraken-abyss/80 backdrop-blur border border-kraken-gold/30 px-4 py-2">
              <p class="font-cinzel text-xs tracking-widest text-kraken-gold uppercase">Abiertos esta Temporada</p>
            </div>
          </div>

          <!-- Floating small badge — the wall mural -->
          <div class="absolute -bottom-8 -right-6 w-40 h-40 border-4 border-kraken-deep overflow-hidden shadow-[0_10px_40px_rgba(0,0,0,0.8)] hidden sm:block">
            <!-- NOTA DEV: Usar foto "pared_kraken.png" — mural del Kraken pintado en la fachada blanca -->
            <img
              src="/imagenes/pared_kraken.png"
              alt="Mural del Kraken"
              class="w-full h-full object-cover transition-transform duration-500 hover:scale-110"
            />
          </div>

          <!-- Gold corner ornaments -->
          <div class="absolute -top-3 -left-3 w-8 h-8 border-t-2 border-l-2 border-kraken-gold/60"></div>
          <div class="absolute -bottom-3 -right-3 w-8 h-8 border-b-2 border-r-2 border-kraken-gold/60 hidden sm:block" style="bottom: -2.75rem; right: -1.25rem;"></div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- RIGHT — Story text -->
      <div class="reveal from-right stagger-children">

        <!-- Big decorative quote mark -->
        <div class="font-pirata text-[8rem] leading-none text-kraken-gold/10 select-none -mb-10 -ml-4">
          "
        </div>

        <h2 class="font-pirata text-4xl md:text-5xl text-kraken-cream leading-tight mb-6">
          Una leyenda<br/>
          <span class="gold-shimmer">nace en la orilla</span>
        </h2>

        <div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-3 md:mb-8">
          <div class="h-px w-12 bg-kraken-gold/50"></div>
          <svg class="w-4 h-4 text-kraken-gold/60" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
            <path d="M12 2a3 3 0 1 1 0 6 3 3 0 0 1 0-6zm1 6.93A5.002 5.002 0 0 0 12 4a5 5 0 0 0-1 .07V8a1 1 0 0 0 2 0V8.93zM7 9a1 1 0 0 0-1 1 6 6 0 0 0 5 5.917V21H9a1 1 0 1 0 0 2h6a1 1 0 1 0 0-2h-2v-5.083A6 6 0 0 0 18 10a1 1 0 1 0-2 0 4 4 0 0 1-8 0 1 1 0 0 0-1-1z"/>
          </svg>
          <div class="h-px w-12 bg-kraken-gold/50"></div>
        </div>

        <p class="font-crimson text-xl text-kraken-sand/90 leading-relaxed mb-2 md:mb-6">
          Dicen que en las profundidades del Mediterráneo duerme una criatura de proporciones legendarias.
          Nosotros la hemos despertado, y la hemos puesto a servir mojitos.
        </p>

        <p class="font-crimson text-lg text-kraken-sand/70 leading-relaxed mb-2 md:mb-6">
          El Kraken Chiringuito es un lugar nuevo, salvaje y honesto. Nacimos frente a la playa de El Prat de Llobregat
          con una misión clara: convertir cada tarde de verano en una aventura que no olvidarás.
          Cócteles que saben a mar, cocina sin pretensiones pero con mucho carácter, y un ambiente
          que se mueve al ritmo de las olas.
        </p>

        <p class="font-crimson italic text-kraken-gold/80 text-lg leading-relaxed mb-3 md:mb-10">
          "No buscamos ser el chiringuito más famoso del Mediterráneo.
          Solo queremos ser el que nunca querrás abandonar."
        </p>

        <!-- Attribute badges -->
        <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-3">
          {[
            { icon: '🌊', label: 'Frente al Mar' },
            { icon: '🍹', label: 'Cócteles Artesanales' },
            { icon: '🐙', label: 'Ambiente Único' },
            { icon: '🎵', label: 'Música en Vivo' },
          ].map(({ icon, label }) => (
            <span class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 border border-kraken-gold/30 text-kraken-sand/80 font-cinzel text-xs tracking-wider px-4 py-2 hover:border-kraken-gold/60 hover:text-kraken-gold transition-all duration-300">
              <span>{icon}</span>
              <span>{label}</span>
            </span>
          ))}
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- ════════════════════════════════════════
         HORIZONTAL STATS ROW
    ════════════════════════════════════════ -->
    <div class="mt-4 md:mt-10 grid grid-cols-2 md:grid-cols-4 gap-px bg-kraken-gold/10 border border-kraken-gold/10 reveal scale-up">
      {[
        { number: '100%', label: 'Frente al Mar', sub: 'Arena bajo los pies' },
        { number: '∞',    label: 'Buenas Vibras', sub: 'Garantizadas' },
        { number: '24',   label: 'Cócteles', sub: 'Cada uno, una historia' },
        { number: '1',    label: 'Kraken', sub: 'El nuestro, el único' },
      ].map(({ number, label, sub }) => (
        <div class="bg-kraken-deep p-8 text-center group hover:bg-kraken-ocean transition-colors duration-300">
          <p class="font-pirata text-4xl md:text-5xl text-kraken-gold group-hover:animate-text-glow transition-all duration-300 mb-1">{number}</p>
          <p class="font-cinzel text-xs tracking-widest text-kraken-cream/90 uppercase mb-1">{label}</p>
          <p class="font-crimson italic text-kraken-sand/50 text-sm">{sub}</p>
        </div>
      ))}
    </div>

  </div>

  <!-- Bottom wave -->
  <div class="absolute bottom-0 left-0 right-0 wave-divider">
    <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 1440 80" preserveAspectRatio="none" style="display:block;">
      <path d="M0,40 C480,80 960,0 1440,40 L1440,80 L0,80 Z" fill="#0a1628"/>
    </svg>
  </div>

</section>
